From: AMD AIC Team <aic@amd.com>
Date: 2026-07-29
Subject: [PATCH] Add llm-emu emulator hooks to vLLM v0.26.0

Wire the vllm_emulator package (from vllm/vllm_emulator/ in the AIC repo)
into three vLLM source files so that:

  1. vllm/v1/engine/core.py      — StepCycleTracer init + per-step record
                                   points; emulator-None guard in step paths
  2. vllm/v1/executor/uniproc_executor.py — executor-level hook that short-
                                   circuits execute_model/sample_tokens with
                                   a timer-resolved Future when
                                   VLLM_EMULATOR_EXECUTOR_HOOK=1
  3. vllm/v1/core/sched/scheduler.py — cosmetic blank-line shim (no logic)

All changes are gated on environment variables and have zero runtime cost
when the emulator is not enabled.

Ported from llm-emu vllm_patches/llm-emu-vllm-0.18.1.patch
(upstream commit a26e8dc7f0, tag ~v0.18.1) to vLLM v0.26.0.

